<div class="diagram-node">Caption states the pattern</div>
:::

<p class="diagram-caption">After the break: joining two tables, then one figure in your project report.</p>

- **Proposal due Sun Nov 15**, 11:59 PM
- **Draft due Sun Nov 29:** needs **3 figures**. Today is practice for them.

